@startuml FINsim Backend Architecture
!theme cerulean
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam DefaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam ArrowColor #8ebef5
skinparam arrowLollipop false

title FINsim Backend Architecture — A/B Testing, 5 Scenarios, 20 Rounds

' ============================================================================
' COMPONENTS
' ============================================================================

package "Entry Points" {
  component [run_simulation.py\n(Simulation Orchestrator)] as RunSimulation
  note right of RunSimulation
    Simulation batch entry point:
    - Cycles through 5 scenarios (S0-S4)
    - ollama_base_url = Config.LLM_HEAVY_URL
    - ollama_model = Config.LLM_HEAVY_MODEL
    - Cache/skip check against MongoDB
      (not file-based)
  end note

  component [advisor.py\n(FastAPI App)] as AdvisorApi
  note right of AdvisorApi
    Separate FastAPI service, own Ollama
    client (OllamaAdvisor, not OllamaClient):
    - POST /api/advisor/chat
    - GET  /health
    - GET  /api/dashboard/scenari
    - GET  /api/dashboard/scenario/{id}
    - GET  /api/dashboard/tutti
    Hardcoded: http://localhost:11434/api/generate
    MODEL_NAME = "gemma4:e4b"
  end note
}

package "Caching" {
  database [MongoDB\nfinsim_analytics] as Mongo
  note right of Mongo
    Collection: simulation_history
    Skip logic: doc with
    scenario_id = "{scenario}_fix11"
    already present → scenario skipped
  end note
}

package "Simulation Engine (Core)" {
  component [SimulationEngine\n(esegui_round)] as SimEngine
  note bottom of SimEngine
    Orchestrates round loop per scenario:
    1. Query active clusters (via Searcher)
    2. Generate strategy per cluster
       (PromotoreAgent)
    3. Compute adequacy:
       ADEGUATEZZA_MATRIX,
       calcola_moltiplicatore_scenario,
       calcola_adeguatezza_dinamica
    4. Apply trust malus,
       calcola_reazione_clienti
    5. Persist DecisioneCommerciale
    A/B split by promoter id substring:
    'ADAPT' vs 'FISSO'
    (see _calcola_metriche_business)
  end note
}

package "Strategy Generation (LLM Layer)" {
  component [PromotoreAgent\nStrategy Generator] as PromAgent
  note bottom of PromAgent
    Level 3 agent (only agent class in
    backend/app/finsim/agents/):
    - Builds system/user prompt from
      scenario + directive + cluster data
    - Constructor default model_name=
      "qwen2.5:3b" (stale placeholder,
      overridden at runtime)
    - Actual model in use: gemma4:e4b
      (LIGHT) / gemma4:31b (HEAVY)
      via Config
    - Parses response with json_repair
  end note

  component [OllamaClient\nREST Interface] as OllamaClient
  note bottom of OllamaClient
    backend/app/finsim/llm/ollama_client.py
    - POST {base_url}/api/generate
    - GET  {base_url}/api/tags (health)
    - Observed endpoint at runtime:
      http://10.12.1.2:11434
    - MAX_RETRIES=1 (retries only on
      Timeout / ConnectionError — a
      plain HTTP 500 is NOT retried)
    - timeout = OLLAMA_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
      env (default 900s)
  end note
}

package "Data Access Layer" {
  component [FinsimSearcher\n(search_finsim.py)] as Searcher
  note bottom of Searcher
    Parameterized Neo4j queries:
    - Allowlist validation (labels, rels)
    - Cluster lookup (grid position)
    - Promoter portfolios
    - Scenario/directive state (read-only)
    Uses: ontology/finsim_schema.json
  end note
}

package "Persistent Storage" {
  database [Neo4j\n(5.15 Community)] as NeoDb
  note bottom of NeoDb
    FINsim graph nodes (created by
    ontology/populate_finsim.py,
    NOT by generic
    storage/neo4j_storage.py):
    - ScenarioMacro (S0-S4)
    - DirettivaBancaria (5 hardcoded,
      one per scenario — see note below)
    - Promotore (Adattivo / Fisso)
    - Cliente (100 synthetic, 10x10 grid)
    - DecisioneCommerciale
    Relationship gap: code uses EFFETTUA
    (Promotore→DecisioneCommerciale),
    which is NOT in finsim_schema.json
    allowed_relationships
  end note
}

' ============================================================================
' RELATIONSHIPS & FLOW
' ============================================================================

RunSimulation --> Mongo : "1. Check cache\n(simulation_history doc?)"
Mongo --> RunSimulation : "Skip or Proceed"

RunSimulation --> SimEngine : "2. Execute scenario\n(if not cached)"

SimEngine --> Searcher : "Query clusters,\npromoter data,\nscenario/directive state"

Searcher --> NeoDb : "Parameterized\nCypher queries"
NeoDb --> Searcher : "Node & relationship\nresults"

SimEngine --> PromAgent : "Generate strategy\nfor cluster"

PromAgent --> OllamaClient : "HTTP POST\n(system + user prompt,\nformat=json)"
OllamaClient --> PromAgent : "JSON strategy\nresponse"

SimEngine --> NeoDb : "Persist decisions\n(DecisioneCommerciale)"
SimEngine --> NeoDb : "Update client trust\n& satisfaction"

SimEngine --> Mongo : "Write simulation_history\ndoc on completion"

AdvisorApi --> NeoDb : "Dashboard queries\n(scenario/round summaries)"

' ============================================================================
' LEGEND & NOTES
' ============================================================================

note as ArchGap
  **Architecture discrepancy vs CLAUDE.md:**
  CLAUDE.md describes Livello 2 (DirettivaBancaria)
  as "1 agente adattivo, elaborato tramite HEAVY_LLM".
  In the current code there is NO such agent class —
  the 5 directives (one per S0-S4) are statically
  pre-generated in populate_finsim.py and only ever
  read back via FinsimSearcher. No dynamic HEAVY_LLM
  call regenerates a directive at runtime.
end note

note as Legend
  **A/B Testing Matrix:**
  - 100 clients total
  - Promotore Fisso (Fixed): 50 clients → Benchmark broadcast
  - Promotore Adattivo (Adaptive): 50 clients → LLM-driven strategy
  - Split detected by promoter id substring 'ADAPT' / 'FISSO'

  **Scenario Execution (S0-S4):**
  - S0: Baseline Neutro (tassi 2.0%, tensione geopolitica)
  - S1: Shock Tassi (rialzo 2.5%, crollo equity)
  - S2: Crisi Acuta (blocco geopolitico, PIL negativo)
  - S3: Opportunità (distensione, pressione compliance)
  - S4: Biforcazione Dinamica (= S0 fino al Round 10, poi
    cambio drastico obbligatorio della DirettivaBancaria)

  **LLM Models (backend/app/config.py):**
  - LLM_HEAVY_MODEL = gemma4:31b
  - LLM_LIGHT_MODEL = gemma4:e4b
  - Both served from the same remote Ollama host
  - advisor.py uses its own hardcoded gemma4:e4b client,
    independent of OllamaClient / config.py

  **Security Model:**
  ✓ Parameterized Neo4j queries (no f-string injection)
  ✓ Label/relationship allowlist (finsim_schema.json)
    — but EFFETTUA relationship is used ungoverned
  ✓ Timeout-aware LLM requests (900s default)
  ⚠ HTTP 5xx from Ollama is NOT retried (only
    Timeout/ConnectionError are) — see ollama_client.py
end note

@enduml
